<title>FINLAND: ELAKE-VARMA 1996 PROFIT UP TO FIM 2.51 BILLION.</title>
<headline>ELAKE-VARMA 1996 PROFIT UP TO FIM 2.51 BILLION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31, 1996-</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit for the year			    2,508 vs 1,188</p>
<p> Net investment income			  2,863 up 11 pct</p>
<p> Turnover					  10,597 vs 9,850</p>
<p> Premium income				   7,190 vs 6,521</p>
<p> Change in valuation			    1,656 vs 625</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish pension insurance company is</p>
<p>Elake-Varma.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0235</p>
</text>
